### UBot Scenario Engine – REST API Test Suite
### IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client format
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Start app with demo profile first:
###   docker compose up mongodb mongo-express   (MongoDB only)
###   java -jar target/ubot-scenario-engine-*-exec.jar --spring.profiles.active=demo

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@baseUrlMock = http://localhost:8082
@scenarioId = {{submit_hello.response.body.correlationId}}

# ── Health check ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Actuator health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Engine stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/stats


# ── HELLO_WORLD scenario ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Submit HELLO_WORLD (single-shot, always OK)
# @name submit_hello
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioCode": "HELLO_WORLD",
  "inputData": "ivosahlik",
  "username": "test-user",
  "submitHostname": "dev-machine"
}

###

### Get status of last submitted HELLO_WORLD
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{scenarioId}}


# ── BATCH_PROCESS scenario ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Submit BATCH_PROCESS with 6 items
# @name submit_batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioCode": "BATCH_PROCESS",
  "inputData": "6",
  "username": "test-user"
}

###

### Get BATCH_PROCESS status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_batch.response.body.correlationId}}


# ── LONG_RUNNING scenario (for signal / suspend testing) ──────────────────────

### Submit LONG_RUNNING (20 iterations, ~10s total)
# @name submit_long
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioCode": "LONG_RUNNING",
  "inputData": "20",
  "username": "test-user"
}

###

### Get LONG_RUNNING status (should be PROCESSING if called quickly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_long.response.body.correlationId}}

###

### Send TERMINATE signal to LONG_RUNNING
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/39cd2ce2-3fe5-4d24-b227-2a803d990a96/signal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signal": "TERMINATE"
}


### ── REPORT_GENERATOR scenario ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Submit REPORT_GENERATOR (uses REPORT concurrency bucket)
# @name submit_report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioCode": "REPORT_GENERATOR",
  "threadCode": "REPORT",
  "inputData": "quarterly-financials",
  "username": "test-user"
}

###

### Get REPORT_GENERATOR status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_report.response.body.correlationId}}


# ── SUSPENDABLE scenario (suspend / resume flow) ──────────────────────────────

### Submit SUSPENDABLE (5 pages)
# @name submit_suspendable
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioCode": "SUSPENDABLE",
  "inputData": "5",
  "username": "test-user"
}

###

### Suspend SUSPENDABLE (send while PROCESSING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_suspendable.response.body.correlationId}}/suspend

###

### Get status (should be SUSPENDED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_suspendable.response.body.correlationId}}

###

### Resume SUSPENDABLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_suspendable.response.body.correlationId}}/unsuspend

###

### Get final status (should be COMPLETED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_suspendable.response.body.correlationId}}


# ── List scenarios by state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all WAITING scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios?state=WAITING

### List all PROCESSING scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios?state=PROCESSING

### List all COMPLETED scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios?state=COMPLETED

### List all FAILED scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios?state=FAILED

### List all SUSPENDED scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios?state=SUSPENDED


# ── Scheduled Jobs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all scheduled jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

###

### Create a new scheduled job (fires every 2 minutes)
# @name create_job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "demo-batch-job",
  "scenarioCode": "BATCH_PROCESS",
  "threadCode": "BATCH_PROCESS",
  "cronExpression": "0 */2 * * * *",
  "enabled": true,
  "inputDataTemplate": "3"
}

###

### Disable the job (update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create_job.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "demo-batch-job",
  "scenarioCode": "BATCH_PROCESS",
  "threadCode": "BATCH_PROCESS",
  "cronExpression": "0 */2 * * * *",
  "enabled": false,
  "inputDataTemplate": "3"
}

###

### Delete the job
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create_job.response.body.id}}


# ── offertool scenario (Kafka offer payload submitted via REST) ───────────────

### Submit offertool – full offer payload (mirrors Kafka consumer input)
# @name submit_offertool
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioCode": "offertool",
  "username": "admintest",
  "inputData": "{\"apiVersion\":1,\"offerId\":7699,\"variantId\":9111,\"testAppLogin\":\"admintest\",\"email\":\"pavel.vanek-ext@ivosahlik.com\",\"ca\":\"1040093072\",\"ico\":\"56150563\",\"bmslVersion\":\"2.0\",\"note\":null,\"internalNote\":null,\"contractId\":\"1-1617870225_0\",\"contractAddenum\":{},\"platform\":\"V4\",\"type\":\"Akvizice\",\"contractDuration\":24,\"realContractDuration\":24,\"previousContractEndDate\":null,\"contractStartDate\":\"2024-01-18T00:00:00.000+00:00\",\"contractEndDate\":\"2026-01-17T00:00:00.000+00:00\",\"payTerm\":18,\"exclusiveDiscount\":0.0,\"postponedSubsidy\":0.0,\"manualSubsidy\":0.0,\"transferredSubsidy\":0.0,\"fines\":0.0,\"clientCommitment\":{\"priceWithVat\":121.0,\"priceWithoutVat\":100.0},\"principalAmount\":0.0,\"newBmsl\":{\"priceWithVat\":121.0,\"priceWithoutVat\":100.0},\"realBmsl\":{\"priceWithVat\":121.0,\"priceWithoutVat\":100.0},\"systemBmsl\":{\"priceWithVat\":121.0,\"priceWithoutVat\":100.0},\"subsidyTotal\":0.0,\"subsidyHw\":200.0,\"billingGroups\":[{\"id\":\"97fbc71d-add7-45c6-8f3d-028329f7d213\",\"billingAccountId\":0,\"recipient\":\"Výchozí\",\"address\":{\"city\":\"Olomouc 1\",\"street\":\"Dr. Milady Horákové\",\"streetNumber\":\"1079/21\",\"postalCode\":\"77900\"},\"volumeDiscounts\":[],\"invoiceDiscounts\":[]}],\"installationPlaces\":[{\"id\":\"305da18a-25f9-4032-bcbb-6140b4e6a0ed\",\"name\":\"BMSL Test\",\"contactPerson\":\"X\",\"contactPhone\":\"420735425136\",\"address\":{\"city\":\"Olomouc 1\",\"street\":\"Dr. Milady Horákové\",\"streetNumber\":\"/1079/21\",\"postalCode\":\"77900\"}}],\"mobileFallback\":{\"priceFixed\":0.0,\"priceMobile\":0.0,\"priceSms\":0.0},\"fixFallback\":{\"priceFixed\":0.0,\"priceMobile\":0.0},\"mobileSubscribers\":[],\"fixSubscribers\":[],\"connectivity\":[],\"others\":[],\"vfWelcome\":null,\"hardware\":[],\"vtv\":[{\"partNo\":\"TVTARIFF001\",\"name\":\"ivosahlik TV - Klasik\",\"itemType\":\"Tarif\",\"serviceId\":null,\"serviceType\":\"New\",\"discount\":0.0,\"billingGroupId\":\"97fbc71d-add7-45c6-8f3d-028329f7d213\",\"installationPlaceId\":\"\",\"addons\":[],\"orderId\":null,\"otherServices\":[]}],\"hardwareRental\":[],\"diffPackages\":[],\"subsidyBudgetUsed\":0.0,\"subsidyBudgetUsedWithVat\":0.0,\"hwBudgetUsed\":0.0,\"hwBudgetUsedWithVat\":0.0,\"variantState\":\"KeZpracovaniRoBotem\",\"invoiceDiscount\":null,\"invoiceDiscountPromo\":null,\"invoiceDiscountPromoMonths\":null,\"inflationaryClause\":true,\"inflationaryClauseStartDate\":null,\"TS\":{\"products\":[]},\"sharedTariffs\":[],\"hasFrozenHwSubsidy\":false,\"frozenHwSubsidyAmount\":0.0,\"frozenHwSubsidyMonths\":0}"
}

###

### Get offertool scenario status (WAITING → PROCESSING → COMPLETED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_offertool.response.body.correlationId}}

###

### Send TERMINATE signal to offertool scenario (if still PROCESSING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/{{submit_offertool.response.body.correlationId}}/signal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signal": "terminate"
}


### Offertool mock data - consumer
GET {{baseUrlMock}}/api/offers/variants


### Create a new scheduled job (fires every 10 sec)
# @name create_job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "offertool-batch-job",
  "scenarioCode": "OFFERTOOL_BATCH_PROCESS",
  "threadCode": "OFFERTOOL_BATCH_PROCESS",
  "cronExpression": "*/10 * * * * *",
  "urlConsumer": "{{baseUrlMock}}/api/offers/variants",
  "enabled": true,
  "inputDataTemplate": "3"
}

###

### Disable the job (update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create_job.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "offertool-batch-job",
  "scenarioCode": "OFFERTOOL_BATCH_PROCESS",
  "threadCode": "OFFERTOOL_BATCH_PROCESS",
  "cronExpression": "*/10 * * * * *",
  "enabled": false,
  "inputDataTemplate": "3"
}

###

### Delete the job
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create_job.response.body.id}}











# ── Concurrent load test (submit multiple scenarios at once) ──────────────────

### Submit 3 concurrent HELLO_WORLD scenarios
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{"scenarioCode": "HELLO_WORLD", "inputData": "Concurrent-1", "username": "load-test"}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{"scenarioCode": "HELLO_WORLD", "inputData": "Concurrent-2", "username": "load-test"}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{"scenarioCode": "HELLO_WORLD", "inputData": "Concurrent-3", "username": "load-test"}
